      <ChainBlock id="652bb46de49b4bb69e55fe2d0ccef436" type="nam" enabled="0"
                  normalize="1" inputGain="0.5" outputGain="0.5" mix="1.0" toneId="78523"
                  toneJson="{&#13;&#10;  &quot;id&quot;: 78523,&#13;&#10;  &quot;user_id&quot;: &quot;a86171c4-1b40-460b-8e60-f62aef7675a0&quot;,&#13;&#10;  &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Two-Rock Studio Overdrive All Flat&quot;,&#13;&#10;  &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Update: 7/29/2026\nA new, driven tone has been added.\n\nTwo-Rock Studio Overdrive &#8211; Neutral Settings\nAll controls except the Master are set to 12 o&#8217;clock. All frequency boost switches are turned off, providing a balanced and neutral representation of the amp&#8217;s core overdrive tone.\n\nTo preserve the amp&#8217;s sense of depth and dynamic response, I paid close attention to gain staging throughout the capture process. As a result, this capture may sound quieter than some of the others.\n\nTry turning up the volume when listening. I think you&#8217;ll find that it captures the texture, dynamics, and feel of the real amp very accurately.\n\nSignal Chain:\nShure SM7B\nRupert Neve Designs Shelford Channel\nRME Fireface UFX III&quot;,&#13;&#10;  &quot;created_at&quot;: &quot;2026-07-28T06:34:09.240781+00:00&quot;,&#13;&#10;  &quot;updated_at&quot;: &quot;2026-07-29T06:55:43.349383+00:00&quot;,&#13;&#10;  &quot;images&quot;: [&#13;&#10;    &quot;https://api.tone3000.com/storage/v1/object/public/images/uwzuir0orbs.jpg&quot;&#13;&#10;  ],&#13;&#10;  &quot;is_public&quot;: true,&#13;&#10;  &quot;links&quot;: [],&#13;&#10;  &quot;models_count&quot;: 0,&#13;&#10;  &quot;favorites_count&quot;: 9,&#13;&#10;  &quot;downloads_count&quot;: 264,&#13;&#10;  &quot;license&quot;: &quot;t3k&quot;,&#13;&#10;  &quot;sizes&quot;: null,&#13;&#10;  &quot;a1_models_count&quot;: 0,&#13;&#10;  &quot;a2_models_count&quot;: 5,&#13;&#10;  &quot;irs_count&quot;: 0,&#13;&#10;  &quot;custom_models_count&quot;: 0,&#13;&#10;  &quot;user&quot;: {&#13;&#10;    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;a86171c4-1b40-460b-8e60-f62aef7675a0&quot;,&#13;&#10;    &quot;avatar_url&quot;: &quot;https://api.tone3000.com/storage/v1/object/public/avatars/